          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphokurehani kpwenye tsi ya Akanani, na kukuphani tsi iyo dza arivyoapira akare enu kukala andakuphani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.19+EXO.34.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 34:19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mundamtengera Mwenyezi Mlungu ana enu a kpwandza a chilume na ana a kpwandza alume a mifugo yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila punda wa mwandzo unaweza kumkombola na mwana ngʼondzi, au ichikala kundamkombola, msongole. Ela chila mwana mvyere wa chilume wa mwanadamu ni mumkombole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku zedzazo, ana enu achikuuzani, ‘Mana ya kuhenda vino nini?’ Hipho mundaajibu muambe, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu wautuluza kula Misiri kpwa uwezowe mkpwulu, kula kahi ya tsi hurikokala atumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao ariphorema kuhurichira huuke kpwa moyo mufu, Mwenyezi Mlungu waolaga chila mwana wa kpwandza mlume wa mwanadamu, na wa nyama kahi ya tsi ya Misiri. Ndiyo mana hunamlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu ana a kpwandza osi a chilume a nyama na kukombola ana ehu a kpwandza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lagizo riri rindakala dza alama mikononi mwehu, na utu wa kuhutambukiza vilanguni mwehu. Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu wahutuluza Misiri kpwa uwezo mkpwulu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao ariphoaruhusu Aiziraeli auke, Mlungu kayaatsapiza na njira ya Filisti hata dzagbwe iyo kala ndiyo njira ya mkato. Mana Mlungu waamba, “Hinya atu achendakuta viha, anaweza kugalukpwa ni mioyo akauya Misiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mlungu waalongoza na njira ya kuzunguluka ya kutsupira jangbwani, kuphiya uphande wa Bahari ya Shamu. Chisha Aiziraeli atuluka Misiri kuno akagbwiririra silaha tayari kpwa viha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
