            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.50.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 50:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 24:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa wahala mifupha ya Yusufu achiphiya nayo, kpwa kukala Yusufu kala akahenda Aiziraeli aape. Iye waamba, “Kpwa kpweli Mlungu andakutivyani, achikutivyani, halani mifupha yangu mphiye nayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Aiziraeli atuluka Sukothi na achendachita kambi mudzi wa Ethamu, ko kanda-kanda ya jangbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waatanguliya. Wakati wa mutsi waalongoza njirani kpwa kuhumira nguzo ya ingu, na wakati wa usiku wakala achialongoza na nguzo ya moho ili aphahe mwanga, kpwa hata aenderere na charo usiku na mutsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo nguzo ya ingu ya wakati wa mutsi, na yo nguzo ya moho, taziukire mbere za Aiziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
